  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{嫌|いや}がる.\n\nGRAMMAR POINT:\n{嫌|いや}がる is formed from ⟦{嫌|いや}→嫌：10232_iya⟧ (disliked) + ⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ (to show signs of). The ⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ suffix indicates observable behavior showing an internal feeling, used when describing others' feelings (not your own).\n\nASPECT: {嫌|いや}がって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing reluctance or aversion.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {嫌|いや}がる: to show dislike (observable behavior)\n- ⟦{嫌|きら}う→嫌う：02048_kirau⟧: to dislike (internal feeling, can be used for self)\n- ⟦{嫌|いや}→嫌：10232_iya⟧だ: to dislike (direct statement of own feelings)",
